fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"analytics/gstanalytics_image_util.html#gst_analytics_image_util_iou_float","fragment":"\n\tgst_analytics_image_util_iou_float\n\n\n\tGstAnalytics.prototype.image_util_iou_float\n\n\n\tGstAnalytics.image_util_iou_float\n\nCalculate the intersection over the union (IoU) of the two areas defined by\nthe bounding box 1 and bounding box 2. IoU is a measure of how much two\nregions overlap.\nReturn: IoU of bb1 and bb2.\nParameters:\nBounding box 1, X coordinate\nBounding box 1, Y coordinate\nBounding box 1, width\nBounding box 1, height\nBounding box 2, X coordinate\nBounding box 2, Y coordinate\nBounding box 2, width\nBounding box 2, height\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\nCalculate the intersection over the union (IoU) of the two areas defined by\nthe bounding box 1 and bounding box 2. IoU is a measure of how much two\nregions overlap.\nReturn: IoU of bb1 and bb2.\nParameters:\nBounding box 1, X coordinate\nBounding box 1, Y coordinate\nBounding box 1, width\nBounding box 1, height\nBounding box 2, X coordinate\nBounding box 2, Y coordinate\nBounding box 2, width\nBounding box 2, height\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\nCalculate the intersection over the union (IoU) of the two areas defined by\nthe bounding box 1 and bounding box 2. IoU is a measure of how much two\nregions overlap.\nReturn: IoU of bb1 and bb2.\nParameters:\nBounding box 1, X coordinate\nBounding box 1, Y coordinate\nBounding box 1, width\nBounding box 1, height\nBounding box 2, X coordinate\nBounding box 2, Y coordinate\nBounding box 2, width\nBounding box 2, height\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\n"});